'''

html += '''    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ SECTION 3: TEMPORAL PATTERNS ═══════════ -->
<section id="temporal-patterns">
  <h2>Temporal Patterns &amp; Decade-by-Decade Breakdown</h2>

  <p>The distribution of Oscar-winning composers across decades reveals a striking tension between consolidation and diversity. Some decades saw a handful of composers dominate repeatedly, while others produced an unusually broad field of distinct winners.</p>

  <div class="chart-wrapper">
    <h4>Unique vs. Repeat Winners by Decade</h4>
