      <div class="ms-title">Alan Menken</div>
      <div class="ms-detail">The only composer to win three consecutive years: <em>The Little Mermaid</em> (1989), <em>Beauty and the Beast</em> (1991), and <em>Aladdin</em> (1992).</div>
    </div>
'''

# Longest gap
if longest_gap:
    html += f'''    <div class="milestone-card">
      <div class="ms-year">Longest Gap Between Wins — {longest_gap[3]} Years</div>
