  <h2>Dataset Overview &amp; Historical Context</h2>

  <p>This analysis draws on a definitive dataset of every Academy Award for Best Original Score, spanning 93 consecutive ceremonies from 1934 (the 6th Academy Awards) through 2026 (the 98th ceremony). The dataset normalizes the category's complex administrative history — including years when the Academy split the award into dramatic and comedy/musical subcategories — into a single canonical winner per ceremony year.</p>

